Hello {PORTAL} team,

Please send my new enquiries (leads) to my business software automatically, as each one arrives.

Web address to send them to: {WEB_ADDRESS}
If you can only send them by e-mail, send them to: {MAIL_ADDRESS}

With each lead please include the buyer's name, mobile number, e-mail and what they asked for. Please tell me when it is switched on, and send one test lead.

Thank you.
